  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0b9404a4-5db8-4925-b104-28397b57be7f"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "returns {head[{w}]} for a length-shortest walk in obj's homotopy class \
(head matches the input wrapper; InfraCircle coerces to InfraString); n / \
UpTo[n] / All controls multiplicity.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"00ca4c1c-d86b-40ad-93d2-061b6a34a806"],

